{{EventEnded|date=27th of November 2025|event=[[Null & Void Event]]}}<div class="align-center"><span class="mainheader">'''Curses'''</span>[[file:CursesFooter.png|200px|center|link=]]
'''Curses''' were special attributes applied to matches that could affect gameplay in the Hard Mode of [[Null & Void Event]], giving players advantages, disadvantages or both. There were nine '''Curses''' in total.
</div>
{{QuoteContainer|
{{QuoteBox|What just happened?! It looks like we've been hit with a curse!|audio = Null&VoidN1Wave6-1.ogg|[[Dispatcher]] on Wave 6 ([[Outpost 16]])}}
}}
==Mechanics==
[[file:CursesVoteUI.png|200px|thumb|'''Curses''' selection vote]]
In Hard Mode of [[Null & Void Event]], at the start of certain waves, the screen would display 3 curses for players to vote and select, with a 60 seconds voting duration. After all players vote, the duration shortens to 3 seconds. The curse with the most votes would be applied for the rest of the game.

Waves needed for each nights for the curses selection to be chosen were as below:
*(Night 1) [[Outpost 16]]: 5 waves
*(Night 2) [[Banlands]]: 5 waves
*(Night 3) [[Blind Faith]]: 6 waves
